From: IJsbrand Slob <ijsbrand@mirast.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 17:55:16 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] [d3d9] Implement adapter group devices

Creates one implicit swapchain per head for D3DCREATE_ADAPTERGROUP_DEVICE.
Inactive until adapters report an adapter group.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
